%I A398318 #22 Aug 19 2026 18:12:29
%S A398318 6,24,72,24,120,432,2688,1728,35640,116160,2388936,3802176,73339344
%N A398318 Number of words of length n over the 6 one-directional face-turn generators {U,D,L,R,F,B} (no inverses, no double turns) whose product in the Rubik's Cube group has the maximum order among all words of that length.
%C A398318 The count is expected to grow combinatorially rather than stabilize, since once a length reaches the plateau order, any admissible length-4 padding word (X X X X) applied in any position that keeps the order unchanged multiplies the number of solutions.
